---
description: Architecture choice
---

ArchitectureComponents {
  UI/Front End {
    WebUI => browser-based frontend
    MobileUI => mobile app (iOS, android, hybrid)
    DesktopUI => desktop application (Windows, Mac, multi-platform)
  }
  Programmatic Interface {
    Network API => REST, GraphQL, or RPC endpoints
    CLI => command-line interface tool
    Library => reusable package/module
  }
  Back End {
    Server => backend business logic
    DAL => database access layer
    Worker => background jobs, message queues
    Realtime => WebSocket, SSE, live updates
  }
}
